    "body": "Icky.\r\n\r\nSo the [spec](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#concept-input-apply) and [MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/input#size) both say `size` doesn't apply to number inputs. I'm not sure if there was logic behind that decision? It does seem reasonable to me to expand it to include number inputs, but yeah I'd be concerned about [compat](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1898214).",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
